# Lazav, Wearer of Faces: it exiles Bot2's Ornithopter from Bot2's graveyard ("target card from a graveyard", any graveyard) and
# investigates; Thraben Inspector makes a second Clue. Sacrificing the first Clue puts the Lazav trigger on the stack with the
# Clue's draw (2 items); Lazav becomes the Ornithopter (CR 707.2), the first draw still waiting (1 item). A copy has only the
# copied card's text, so sacrificing the second Clue the same turn adds only its draw (2 items, not 3): nothing is asked.

